<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<<beastejaculation>>
	The <<beasttype>> grunts in satisfaction, and leaps out the window, leaving you lying on the floor.
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you rise to your feet. You look around and see quite a destruction behind you.<<crimeUp 7 "destruction">><<crime "destruction">>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	The <<beasttype>> yelps and flees through the window.
	<br><br>
	<<tearful>> you rise to your feet. You look around and see quite a destruction behind you.<<crimeUp 10 "destruction">><<crime "destruction">>
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Housekeeping Classroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>